lib/include/ - public API
=========================

    cgra.h    the entire public interface. Include this and nothing else.

What lives here
---------------
- geometry macros            CGRA_ROWS/COLS/NUM_PE/DATA_W, CGRA_PROTO_VER
- enum cgra_op / cgra_sel    ALU opcodes and operand-mux selects
- CGRA_CFG(op,a,b,imm)       pack one 32-bit PE config word
- CGRA_OK / CGRA_ERR_*       return codes (0 ok, negative errors)
- cgra_t, cgra_info_t, cgra_stats_t
- functions: connection, primitives (configure/write/run/read/reset/apply),
  and the vector kernels (cgra_vec_*, cgra_dot)

Style
-----
Plain Unix block comments, no doxygen tags. The header is meant to be read
top to bottom as the reference; the man page libcgra(3) mirrors it.

Sync
----
The opcode/select values and protocol constants must equal those in
hw/rtl/cgra_pkg.vhd and lib/src/emu.c.
